        fibo-sec-eq-eq:PreferredShareWithFixedRateDividend,
        fibo-sec-sec-lst:RegisteredSecurity ;
    skos:definition "preferred share that confers multiple votes per share, may be redeemed at the option of the issuer and/or of the shareholder with an extendable redemption date, provides a periodic stated income and participates with common shareholders in further dividend and capital distributions, and is registered" .

