        fibo-sec-eq-eq:NonVotingShare,
        fibo-sec-sec-lst:RegisteredSecurity ;
    skos:definition "preferred share that confers zero votes per share, may be exchanged for securities of another issuer, may be redeemed at the option of the issuer and/or of the shareholder, provides the same dividends as common/ordinary shareholders, and is registered" .

