        fibo-sec-eq-eq:SingleVotingShare,
        fibo-sec-sec-lst:RegisteredSecurity ;
    skos:definition "preferred share that confers exactly one vote per share, may be redeemed at the option of the issuer and/or of the shareholder, provides a periodic income whose dividend rate is set periodically, and is registered" .

fibo-sec-eq-10962:PreferredVotingRedeemableAuctionRateIncomeRegisteredShare a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "preferred, voting, redeemable, auction rate income, registered share"@en-US,
        "单一表决权、可赎回、拍卖利率收益优先股（PreferredVotingRedeemableAuctionRateIncomeRegisteredShare）"@zh ;
    rdfs:comment "优先股：每股享有一票表决权；发行人或股东可选择赎回；股息率通过拍卖定期重置，记名股份。属 ISO 10962（CFI）股票分类中的组合类别个体。"@zh ;
